[b]SPECIAL BRICKS & MECHANICS:[/b]
• [color=orange]Explosive Bricks:[/color] Triggers 3x3 blast radius on destruction!
• [color=gold]Armored Bricks:[/color] Multi-hit dark & gold reinforced walls.
• [color=magenta]Portal Bricks:[/color] Teleports incoming ball across the grid!
• [color=cyan]Hazards:[/color] Avoid Mines, Spikes, and Plasma Turrets firing down!

[b]POWERUPS:[/b]
• Multiball, Laser Cannons, Sticky Paddle, Fireball, Bottom Shield, 2x Score!"

